\newlabel{fig:endpoint-constant-diagrams}{{9}{17}{Endpoint diagrams for the constants in \eqref {eq:endpoint-constants}. Each panel separates the local ReLU atom from the external transport: \(V\) has no transported NTK leg, \(C\) has one off-diagonal NTK leg, and \(A\) has two}{figure.caption.13}{}}
